# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Variables de entorno.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Configuración por entorno (`--dart-define-from-file`): se versionan solo las
# plantillas `*.example.json`. Todo lo que se compila dentro de la app es extraíble
# del APK/IPA, así que ahí solo van valores públicos (URL del API, Client ID de
# Google), nunca claves de servidor.
/env/*.json
!/env/*.example.json

# Llaves, certificados y credenciales (firma de apps, Google, Firebase, Apple).
*.jks
*.key
*.keystore
*.mobileprovision
*.p12
*.p8
*.pem
*.pfx
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
*service-account*.json
GoogleService-Info.plist
client_secret*.json
google-services.json
key.properties